# Project-owned Zoom routing manifest. Covers the Zoom site, the web client and
# the desktop app. Shared third-party hosts Zoom also loads (googleapis.com,
# gstatic.com, googletagmanager.com, cookielaw.org, hcaptcha.com) stay out, so
# selecting Zoom does not pull general Google traffic into the tunnel.
learn-zoom.us
zoom.com
zoom.us
zoomdev.us
zoomstatus.com
